 change while it sounds, and disabling or removing the Note Filter ends the notes it let through. It is also available in the scripting API as NoteFilter.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"blotcms/blot","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T11:22:04Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"92f4f21b0151c141cf6ff126dd7793be12e8078f","github_link":"https://github.com/blotcms/blot/commit/92f4f21b0151c141cf6ff126dd7793be12e8078f","commit_subject":"Move the Git client's blog folder access onto storage/folder (#2371)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"woocommerce/woocommerce","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T11:21:55Z","branch":"trunk","commit_sha":"ab8823afcf5daf4aa8c26e77d54db604afc88d12","github_link":"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/commit/ab8823afcf5daf4aa8c26e77d54db604afc88d12","commit_subject":"[Email Editor] Update PHPStan to 2.3.4 (#70443)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"react/react-native","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T11:21:18Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"7230b63b3e25a28f402d8bc84d35014c405fe1aa","github_link":"https://github.com/react/react-native/commit/7230b63b3e25a28f402d8bc84d35014c405fe1aa","commit_subject":"Skip copying the culling context in the differ when view culling is off","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"BasedHardware/omi","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T11:20:53Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"5203e796418128872b3c74cadaba2bd46d37bc3b","github_link":"https://github.com/BasedHardware/omi/commit/5203e796418128872b3c74cadaba2bd46d37bc3b","commit_subject":"refactor(held-recovery): move subscription-event releases out of the payment router","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"BasedHardware/omi","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T11:20:49Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"ccfdc12d462c95c8c865754f0f556d8e74828cd0","github_link":"https://github.com/BasedHardware/omi/commit/ccfdc12d462c95c8c865754f0f556d8e74828cd0","commit_subject":"fix(dream): read state plan drop counts through public properties","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"Samsung/qaboard","commit_time